CastTrace Android

This Android application is based on and adapted from StreamCap:
https://github.com/ihmily/StreamCap

Upstream project: StreamCap, by ihmily and contributors.
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

This repository contains Android-specific development and modifications,
including Kotlin/Compose UI, local recording services, Android storage,
platform resolvers, playback and device tests. It does not contain the desktop
application or claim to be an official upstream Android distribution.

Huya source resolution was compared with the streamget implementation used by
the desktop application. Third-party dependencies retain their own licenses.
